                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buzuba obo Hamani wakaya kakondwa akusangalilwa. Pele, naakabona kuti Moodekai takwakaima nokuba kukankama kunembo lyakwe akuMulyango wamwami, wakamukalalila kapati Moodekai, ",
          "type": "text",
