            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "elyo wakabakananina akaambo kabuvubi bupati bwakwe alimwi amweelwe wabana bakwe, akusumpuka nkwaakajana kumwami, alimwi mwami mbwaakamusumpula ajulu lyabasimutwe bamwami abakamboni. ",
          "type": "text",
