        {
          "text": "Elyo mukaakwe Zeresi abazwalani boonse bakati kulinguwe, Kacibambwa caanzikilo, bulamfu bwaco madumpwa aali kumi; kokanana amwami cifumo kuti Moodekai ajayilwe alincico, elyo koya kupobwe amoyo uukede. Eci cakamukonda Hamani, waka cita kuti caanzikilo cikabambwe.",
